COMPILATION OF: E46N12

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N12

   1 a 0000 E46N12:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] RUNTIME: BARE SKIP BEFORE ANY OUTPUT.
   4 a 0006      Does a file skip advance from the CURRENT position or
   5 a 0006      from the start of a record that has nothing written
   6 a 0006      in it yet?  E46N11 answers the other half. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N12OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) skip;
  10 c 0037   put file(outf) list('A');
  11 c 0051   close file(outf);
  12 c 0057   stop;
  13 a 005A end E46N12;

CODE SIZE = 005A
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 389A
END  COMPILATION
